WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:07.000
New York is one of the few places&nbsp;
you can get around without a car.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:17.770
The subways, they're crummy and&nbsp;
they're dangerous. You get pushed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:23.260
you get shoved sometimes you get mugged&nbsp;
in this subway during the daylight!&nbsp;

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:35.800
I can remember when public transportation was&nbsp;
one of the prides of New York. What's happened??

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:44.520
The bad thing about New York is the pressure.&nbsp;
You're always under pressure because everyone else&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:53.310
seems to be. New York is almost broke and you know&nbsp;
why because too much money is going to the suburbs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.310 --> 00:01:04.290
they're killing us. What I like about driving a&nbsp;
cab is you get to meet all sorts of people. You&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:11.250
know like I had an ambassador from the UN this&nbsp;
morning and screen actors. What I don't like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:17.100
about the job are the kooks and there are more&nbsp;
of them all the time. I've been held up twice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:24.690
but this is where the money is and as long as you&nbsp;
gotta make a living that's where you gotta be.

